        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "From 1 April 2026: if an EAEU electronic passport exists, its power is used. Otherwise: up to 250 hp ÷ 1.5; above 250 hp: 250 ÷ 1.5 + the rest ÷ 2.5."
